              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Conduction disturbances—atrioventricular",
              "pdf_page": 489,
              "printed_page": 407,
              "column": 2,
              "subheading": "ECG"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "(AV) block, arrhythmias, and ST segment",
              "pdf_page": 489,
              "printed_page": 407,
              "column": 2,
              "subheading": "ECG"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "depression in some patients.",
              "pdf_page": 489,
              "printed_page": 407,
              "column": 2,
              "subheading": "ECG"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Digoxin can cause any arrhythmia.",
              "pdf_page": 489,
              "printed_page": 407,
